{'symbol': 'HUM', 'date': '2023-03-22 09:00:00', 'title': 'DAVID A. JONES ELECTED CHAIRMAN OF THE HUMANA FOUNDATION BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': 'LOUISVILLE, KY.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE HUMANA FOUNDATION, PHILANTHROPIC ARM OF HUMANA INC. (NYSE: HUM) FOR THE PAST 41 YEARS, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT DAVID A. JONES JR. HAS BEEN ELECTED TO SERVE AS CHAIRMAN OF THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS, EFFECTIVE AS OF APRIL 1, 2023. JONES IS A CURRENT BOARD MEMBER WITH OVER 26 YEARS OF DEDICATED SERVICE TO THE HUMANA FOUNDATION. SINCE 1993, JONES HAS SERVED ON THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS FOR HUMANA INC.'}